		'port.blacksmith.exit_warn_med': 'You done? You\'ve got some gold at least, but there\'s definitely more in the mine. You should be able to get _40 pieces._\n\n_Remember, I\'m not lettin\' you back in once you come up._',
		'port.blacksmith.exit_warn_high': 'You done? Looks like you\'ve got a good amount of gold, but I could use a bit more. You should be able to get _40 pieces._\n\n_Remember, I\'m not lettin\' you back in once you come up._',
