		'port.skeletonkey.desc': 'An important-looking key with a head shaped like a skull. Its teeth seem to be different every time you look at them.',
		'port.skeletonkey.desc_worn': 'This magical key seems to gain power as you use it instead of the dungeon\'s regular keys. It can be inserted into almost any of the dungeon\'s locks to either open or close them, including doors that were never locked previously.\n\nThe key can even be used on empty space in a cardinal or diagonal direction to \'lock\' the air in front of you, creating a 3 tile wide solid wall that lasts for 10 turns. Locking will push away enemies if there is space to do so.',
